      "release_notes": "Bugfixes\n- PICARD-3511 - Saving embedded artwork fails when setting the artwork for multiple selected files\n- PICARD-3525 - Restore Defaults uses wrong values for plugins\n- PICARD-3538 - Unable to change cover art provider order\n- PICARD-3541 - Views stay suspended and the pending files count never reaches zero when a file is removed while it is still loading\n- PICARD-3542 - \"Automatically cluster all new files\" can skip clustering depending on which file finishes loading last\n- PICARD-3543 - CD lookup reads a wrong drive name when the CD lookup devices setting has spaces or empty items\n- PICARD-3550 - After filtering the \"Unmatched Files\" entry shows up for all loaded releases\n- PICARD-3554 - Hovering over the closing % of a variable shows an empty tooltip\n- PICARD-3556 - CLI: command alias \"plugin uninstall\" not working\n- PICARD-3559 - Crash on logout error if option window was closed\nImprovements\n- PICARD-3553 - Allow setting PICARD_FORCE_FUSION=0 to opt-out of using Qt's Fusion style",
